# Force LF line endings on checkout regardless of platform. Without
# this, Windows git checkouts (core.autocrlf=true, the default on
# GitHub-hosted windows-latest runners) convert LF to CRLF, which
# silently breaks TestFixtureGolden's exact string comparison between
# the CRLF-converted checked-out expected.json and the LF-only output
# of Go's encoding/json (which never emits CR).
* text=auto eol=lf
